==================================================================1700 1451   10
The Livermore Evaluated Atomic Data Library (EADL) in the         1700 1451   11
ENDF-6 Format. Translated from the Livermore ENDL format          1700 1451   12
to the ENDF-6 Format by Bob MacFarlane (Los Alamos).              1700 1451   13
